{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:13 2026-06-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:13 2026-06-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:13 2026-06-14 HKT</p><p>油塘高超道油塘中心對出一段行人路，今日（6月14日）下午6時許有水管爆裂，泥水衝破路磚，如瀑布沿斜路湧下，有汽車需要涉水而行。警方接報到場拉起封鎖範圍，避免途人靠近深坑；水務署接報趕至，關上水掣並開始搶修。</p><img alt=\"泥水衝破路磚，如瀑布沿斜路湧下。FB：龐智笙\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63c4d4c71fd1d029fdaa9a3b5400406e/2026-06/724429724_1963937171001682_6037907726039802487_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場遺留一個深坑。FB：龐智笙\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7080e4867528e961d9e92a780ad2bea6/2026-06/723779160_1963972370998162_1401042932345889205_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場遺留一個深坑。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b433fbe3232d45d5399a38b91a01dd57/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-14_at_20_30_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方拉起封鎖範圍，避免途人靠近。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35772466761ea7ea94850c83e60039a1/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-14_at_20_30_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水務署人員在場搶修。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aa386660ce0e309c7913936b2202b0a2/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-14_at_20_30_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為油塘高超道油塘中心對出一段行人路。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/adf2483bff8bc6c9112b87b6cd08ad9d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-14_at_20_30_08_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-14T13:17:53.523121+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}